@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
skinparam maxMessageSize 190
title Native save and editable author metadata
actor Teacher
participant "Repository\ncopy_to_area" as Repository
participant "Native draft\nFile API" as Draft
participant "Course folder\nFile API" as Folder
database "Original\nattribution" as Attribution
Teacher -> Repository : Select and copy under editable policy
Repository -> Attribution : Capture original author / licence
Repository -> Draft : Copy with serialized source marker
Teacher -> Draft : Save the editing form
Draft -> Folder : Save author, licence and inner source
Teacher -> Folder : Reopen existing materials
Folder -> Draft : Prepare draft with ID = 0
Teacher -> Draft : Rename / change current author and licence
Draft -> Folder : Save current values and retained marker
note over Folder, Attribution
Current file values may change.
Captured original declaration stays unchanged.
This is not a strict author lock.
end note
@enduml

